flowchart LR
    Domain[Domain State<br/>business truth]
    Workflow[Application Workflow State<br/>pending coordination]
    TargetUI[Target-System Presentation State<br/>what its users see]
    External[External Observed State<br/>provider/device reports]
    Infra[Infrastructure State<br/>connection/retry/cache]
    BuilderView[Project Builder View State<br/>canvas layout and selection]

    External -->|interpreted by rules| Domain
    Domain -->|projected| TargetUI
    Workflow -->|status observation| TargetUI
    Infra -->|degraded observation| TargetUI
    BuilderView -. renders model without changing .-> Domain
